## Reminder: `player_daily_stat` is still not deployed

Confirmed against prod on 2026-07-26: `Table 'osbase.player_daily_stat' doesn't
exist`. The contract has been ready since then.

Nothing on the site is broken while it waits — the Highlights widget says
"nobody played yesterday" and degrades cleanly. But **`rating` per day cannot be
reconstructed.** A value that was never written down for a given day is gone,
and every day without the module is a permanent hole in both the form curve and
the highlights.

That is not a nice-to-have. It is data expiring while we wait.

